{"1446900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Fallen Tear: The Ascension","steam_appid":1446900,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5213180],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.webp?t=1793190960\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/3f85eb5300f24cf695c53f198fe3a968.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=694 height=428 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.webm?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f6808537e29877029300b6957342931e.mp4?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.webm?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/ede905e28bd91d73178e0d3985241d5b.mp4?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Classic-Inspired Journey, Reimagined in a Modern Metroidvania World<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Hira, a mysterious child born with the dark element fated to stand against ancient gods. Fallen Tear: The Ascension combines the emotional weight and party-building of classic JRPGs with the freeform exploration of Metroidvanias, plus a touch of souls-like challenge. Every death teaches. Every bond matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Love Letter to Gamers - Told Through a Hand-Drawn Metroidvania + JRPG Fusion<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Tear: The Ascension is a traditionally animated 2D Metroidvania focused on exploration, slick combat, and a narrative-driven story filled with compelling and lovable characters. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each graphic element, animated sprite, and music note has been lovingly hand-crafted to ensure the best audiovisual experience.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 enemies to combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 interactable biomes (Silent Spring, Lilac Mire, Godspire Ruins, and more)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Fates Bonds, each with its own unique abilities, storylines, and quests.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different combat and skill trees to unlock (Elemental Imbuements, Ascension skills, and more)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster hunts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game’s intended length: on average = 30 - 40 hours<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.webm?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/995316fd0adee57294d109307e05366c.mp4?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f1cb490943038c57d3cdb325971b77e1.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f1cb490943038c57d3cdb325971b77e1.webm?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/f1cb490943038c57d3cdb325971b77e1.mp4?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become Raoah's Fiercest Warrior<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Slash, parry, and dodge attacks coming from every direction. Customize Hira's loadout with a deep well of combat skills and abilities, then learn enemy attack patterns, swap weapons and items on the fly, and shift strategies mid-battle to keep even the toughest bosses guessing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/958a7933ccf7138ff1b0732a7b11db74.poster.avif?t=1793190960\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1446900\/extras\/958a7933ccf7138ff1b0732a7b11db74.webm?t=1793190960\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asse